      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T15:56:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is why part of me wanted things that needed a buffer transfer to go through the transfer buffer manager class so all the logic could be in there. Like it would be great if the GPU vertex buffer just had to worry and aligning things for offsets and possibly total size. Is the total size a restriction from the copying or is that something that comes from the actual use of the buffer as a draw buffer?\n\nAnyways, the downsides and why we didn\u0027t end up using the UploadBufferManager is that we have to accept doing N vertex copies (one per draw) since we can\u0027t request one large buffer since we don\u0027t know what size we\u0027ll need yet.",
